                  <description>3.2.2 Create Person (Interface i619). CPD generates and returns a new personVinciId. **CPD requires at least one contract embedded directly in this call** (confirmed by a real 400 "The Contracts field is required" - the design doc's assumption of a separate follow-up Create/Update Contract call for the initial contract does not hold), so this action's input/body now includes the contract fields too; CreateOrUpdateContract remains a separate call only for the update path. Consumed by p_CreatePersonAndContract (build guide 4.8).</description>
