                       maxRedirects="100"
                       name="CreateOrUpdateContract"
                       preemptiveAuth="true"
                       responseEncoding="">
                  <description>3.2.4 Create / Update Contract. PATCH endpoint against an existing contractId. **No longer used on the Create path** - confirmed against the live API that CPD's Create Person endpoint requires the initial contract embedded in the same request (see CreatePerson's description/notes), so this action is now only consumed by p_UpdatePersonAndContract for updating an existing contract (build guide 4.9).</description>
